  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Core funding to sustain HD&#x2019;s programme of work 2021, the durability and the agility of its operation and peacemaking interventions, enabling the organisation to adapt to the ever-changing dynamics of conflict. HD works in partnership with Ireland to drive complementarity and maximize impacts in conflict-affected contexts, building greater sustainability to the agreements HD supports. The contribution promotes the ultimate outcome and concrete objectives of HD&#x2019;s 2019-2023 strategy.</narrative>
